#. (itstool) path: component/name
#: org.kde.marknote.metainfo.xml:8
msgid "Marknote"
msgstr "Marknote"

#. (itstool) path: component/summary
#: org.kde.marknote.metainfo.xml:9
msgid "Write down your thoughts"
msgstr "Zapišite svoje misli"

#. (itstool) path: description/p
#: org.kde.marknote.metainfo.xml:11
msgid "Marknote lets you create rich text notes and easily organise them into notebooks. You can personalise your notebooks by choosing an icon and accent color for each one, making it easy to distinguish between them and keep your notes at your fingertips. Your notes are saved as Markdown files in your Documents folder, making it easy to use your notes outside of Marknote as well as inside the app."
msgstr "Marknote omogućuje stvaranje bilješki s obogaćenim tekstom i njihovo jednostavno organiziranje u bilježnice. Bilježnice možete personalizirati odabirom ikone i boje isticanja za svaku od njih pa ćete ih lakše razlikovati, a bilješke imati nadohvat ruke. Bilješke se spremaju kao Markdown datoteke u mapu Dokumenti, što olakšava njihovu uporabu i izvan aplikacije Marknote."

#. (itstool) path: description/p
#: org.kde.marknote.metainfo.xml:36
msgid "This release is packed with new features, including support for subfolders, an optional background blur effect, note search in the command bar, and emoji auto-completion."
msgstr "Ovo izdanje donosi mnoštvo novih značajki, uključujući podršku za podmape, neobavezni efekt zamućenja pozadine, pretraživanje bilješki u naredbenoj traci i automatsko dovršavanje emojija."

#. (itstool) path: description/p
#: org.kde.marknote.metainfo.xml:42
msgid "Small bug fix release, mainly to fix deleting notebooks and some other minor changes."
msgstr "Manje izdanje s ispravcima grešaka, uglavnom za rješavanje problema s brisanjem bilježnica i nekoliko drugih manjih promjena."

#. (itstool) path: description/p
#: org.kde.marknote.metainfo.xml:48
msgid "Marknote 1.5.1 contains various bug fixes, including the ones for specific issues while coping and pasting. This release also adds some tiny improvements like syntax highlighting in the source mode and faster image loading."
msgstr "Marknote 1.5.1 sadrži razne ispravke grešaka, uključujući rješenja određenih problema pri kopiranju i lijepljenju. Ovo izdanje donosi i manja poboljšanja, poput isticanja sintakse u izvornom načinu rada i bržeg učitavanja slika."

#. (itstool) path: description/p
#: org.kde.marknote.metainfo.xml:54
msgid "Marknote 1.5 introduces major new features like Source Mode for raw Markdown editing, cross-notebook wiki-style links, and a KRunner plugin for quickly opening notes from the Plasma desktop. The release also improves note organization, editor auto-formatting, media handling, UI animations, and overall stability with many quality-of-life updates and bug fixes."
msgstr "Marknote 1.5 donosi velike nove značajke, poput izvornog načina rada za uređivanje čistog Markdowna, poveznica u stilu Wikija između bilježnica i dodatka za KRunner koji omogućuje brzo otvaranje bilješki s radne površine Plasme. Ovo izdanje poboljšava i organizaciju bilješki, automatsko oblikovanje u uređivaču, rukovanje medijima, animacije sučelja te ukupnu stabilnost brojnim praktičnim poboljšanjima i ispravcima grešaka."

#. (itstool) path: description/p
#: org.kde.marknote.metainfo.xml:61
msgid "This release contains a large number of bug fixes and small improvements."
msgstr "Ovo izdanje sadrži velik broj ispravaka grešaka i manjih poboljšanja."

#. (itstool) path: ul/li
#: org.kde.marknote.metainfo.xml:65
msgid "You can now undo and redo changes in the quick sketch dialog"
msgstr "Sada možete poništiti i ponoviti promjene u dijalogu za brzo skiciranje"

#. (itstool) path: ul/li
#: org.kde.marknote.metainfo.xml:66
msgid "You can now drag and drop images"
msgstr "Sada možete povlačiti i ispuštati slike"

#. (itstool) path: ul/li
#: org.kde.marknote.metainfo.xml:67
msgid "The main view no longer disappears when resizing sidebars"
msgstr "Glavni prikaz više ne nestaje pri promjeni veličine bočnih traka"

#. (itstool) path: ul/li
#: org.kde.marknote.metainfo.xml:68
msgid "Issues with delete dialogs have been fixed"
msgstr "Ispravljeni su problemi s dijalozima za brisanje"

#. (itstool) path: description/p
#: org.kde.marknote.metainfo.xml:75
msgid "On small phone screens, you want as much space as possible to write and read your notes. Marknote now lets you hide the editor toolbar on mobile, so you can focus on the important stuff while having the formatting options just a tap away."
msgstr "Na malim zaslonima telefona želite što više prostora za pisanje i čitanje bilješki. Marknote sada omogućuje skrivanje alatne trake uređivača na mobilnim uređajima, pa se možete usredotočiti na važno, a mogućnosti oblikovanja ostaju dostupne jednim dodirom."

#. (itstool) path: description/p
#: org.kde.marknote.metainfo.xml:81
msgid "On desktop, you can now adjust the width of the note list and editor by dragging the separator, just like in other desktop applications."
msgstr "Na računalu sada možete prilagoditi širinu popisa bilješki i uređivača povlačenjem razdjelnika, kao i u drugim računalnim aplikacijama."

#. (itstool) path: description/p
#: org.kde.marknote.metainfo.xml:85
msgid "You can now undo and redo changes using buttons in the UI, rather than relying on keyboard shortcuts, which is especially helpful if you're using a virtual keyboard that may not have a control key. The application menu has been reorganized and simplified to make it less cluttered."
msgstr "Promjene sada možete poništiti i ponoviti gumbima u sučelju umjesto tipkovnim prečacima, što je osobito korisno ako upotrebljavate virtualnu tipkovnicu bez tipke Control. Izbornik aplikacije reorganiziran je i pojednostavljen kako bi bio pregledniji."

#. (itstool) path: description/p
#: org.kde.marknote.metainfo.xml:93
msgid "We added implemented clickable links! You can now ctrl-click links to open them."
msgstr "Dodali smo podršku za poveznice na koje se može kliknuti! Sada ih možete otvoriti klikom uz pritisnutu tipku Ctrl."

#. (itstool) path: description/p
#: org.kde.marknote.metainfo.xml:96
msgid "To make it easier to switch from your current notes application to Marknote, Marknote now offers several import options. For now you can import your notes from KNotes and maildir."
msgstr "Kako bismo olakšali prelazak s trenutačne aplikacije za bilješke na Marknote, dodali smo nekoliko mogućnosti uvoza. Zasad možete uvesti bilješke iz KNotesa i Maildira."

#. (itstool) path: description/p
#: org.kde.marknote.metainfo.xml:105
msgid "Bug fixes release containing the following fixes:"
msgstr "Izdanje s ispravcima grešaka koje sadrži sljedeća rješenja:"

#. (itstool) path: ul/li
#: org.kde.marknote.metainfo.xml:107
msgid "Fix saving font"
msgstr "Ispravak spremanja fonta"

#. (itstool) path: ul/li
#: org.kde.marknote.metainfo.xml:108
msgid "Remember last window state"
msgstr "Pamćenje posljednjeg stanja prozora"

#. (itstool) path: ul/li
#: org.kde.marknote.metainfo.xml:109
msgid "Close dialog after deleting note"
msgstr "Zatvaranje dijaloga nakon brisanja bilješke"

#. (itstool) path: ul/li
#: org.kde.marknote.metainfo.xml:110
msgid "Fix double copy paste"
msgstr "Ispravak dvostrukog kopiranja i lijepljenja"

#. (itstool) path: ul/li
#: org.kde.marknote.metainfo.xml:111
msgid "Fix sidebar not scrollable when there is a note books overflow"
msgstr "Ispravak pomicanja bočne trake kada u njoj ima previše bilježnica"

#. (itstool) path: description/p
#: org.kde.marknote.metainfo.xml:117
msgid "We improved the notes management with the ability to choose a custom folder where to store your notes and made it possible to change the sorting of notes from alphabetically to by date. The sidebar is now collapsible and we added a focus mode where everything but the text editor is displayed."
msgstr "Poboljšali smo upravljanje bilješkama mogućnošću odabira prilagođene mape za njihovu pohranu te promjene razvrstavanja bilješki s abecednog na kronološko. Bočnu traku sada je moguće sklopiti, a dodali smo i način rada za fokus u kojem se prikazuje samo uređivač teksta."

#. (itstool) path: description/p
#: org.kde.marknote.metainfo.xml:124
msgid "If you prefer to just use Marknote as a Markdown editor, we made it possible to just open any markdown files directly from the file browser or the console. Additionally Marknote supports markdown files with a so called front matter, which is a common way to inject metadata to markdown in static website generators like Hugo and Jekyll."
msgstr "Ako Marknote želite upotrebljavati samo kao uređivač Markdowna, sada možete izravno otvoriti Markdown datoteke iz preglednika datoteka ili konzole. Marknote podržava i Markdown datoteke s takozvanim uvodnim metapodacima (front matter), uobičajenim načinom umetanja metapodataka u Markdown u generatorima statičnih web-stranica kao što su Hugo i Jekyll."

#. (itstool) path: description/p
#: org.kde.marknote.metainfo.xml:132
msgid "In term of edition support, the subset of markdown supported increased again. Now it is possible to add and edit tables. Additionally we started transforming inline markdown directly to rich text as you type. Support is limited to a few markdown constructs but is likely to grow over time. You can now customize the font used by editor."
msgstr "Podrška za uređivanje proširena je novim elementima Markdowna. Sada je moguće dodavati i uređivati tablice. Osim toga, ugrađeni Markdown počinje se pretvarati u obogaćeni tekst dok tipkate. Podržano je nekoliko Markdown elemenata, a njihov će se broj s vremenom povećavati. Sada možete prilagoditi i font uređivača."

#. (itstool) path: description/p
#: org.kde.marknote.metainfo.xml:140
msgid "Aside from being able to edit text, it's now possible to also create sketches directly from Marknote."
msgstr "Osim uređivanja teksta, sada je moguće stvarati i skice izravno u Marknoteu."

#. (itstool) path: description/p
#: org.kde.marknote.metainfo.xml:144
msgid "Finally we took care of ensuring Marknote was fully usable when used with Plasma Mobile."
msgstr "Napokon smo osigurali da Marknote bude potpuno funkcionalan i u sustavu Plasma Mobile."

#. (itstool) path: description/p
#: org.kde.marknote.metainfo.xml:152
msgid "Fix an important bug"
msgstr "Ispravak važne greške"

#. (itstool) path: description/p
#: org.kde.marknote.metainfo.xml:158
msgid "Marknote 1.1.0 is out! Marknote is the new WYSIWYG note-taking application from KDE. Despite the latest release being just a few days ago, we have been hard at work and added a few new features and, more importantly, fixed some bugs."
msgstr "Dostupan je Marknote 1.1.0! Marknote je nova KDE-ova aplikacija za bilješke s WYSIWYG uređivanjem. Iako je prethodno izdanje objavljeno prije samo nekoliko dana, naporno smo radili, dodali nekoliko novih značajki i, što je još važnije, ispravili neke greške."

#. (itstool) path: description/p
#: org.kde.marknote.metainfo.xml:164
msgid "Marknote now boasts broader Markdown support, and can now display images and task lists in the editor. And once you are done editing your notes, you can export them to various formats, including PDF, HTML and ODT."
msgstr "Marknote sada nudi širu podršku za Markdown te u uređivaču može prikazivati slike i popise zadataka. Nakon uređivanja bilješke možete izvesti u različite formate, uključujući PDF, HTML i ODT."

#. (itstool) path: description/p
#: org.kde.marknote.metainfo.xml:170
msgid "Marknote's interface now seamlessly integrates the colors assigned to your notebooks, enhancing its visual coherence and making it easier to distinguish one notebook from another. Additionally, your notebooks remember the last opened note, automatically reopening it upon selection."
msgstr "Sučelje Marknotea sada skladno prikazuje boje dodijeljene bilježnicama, čime se poboljšava vizualna usklađenost i olakšava njihovo razlikovanje. Osim toga, bilježnice pamte posljednju otvorenu bilješku i automatski je ponovno otvaraju pri odabiru."

#. (itstool) path: description/p
#: org.kde.marknote.metainfo.xml:176
msgid "We've also introduced a convenient command bar similar to the one in Merkuro. This provides quick access to essential actions within Marknote. Currently it only creates a new notebook and note, but we plan to make more actions available in the future. Finally we have reworked all the dialogs in Markdown to use the newly introduced FormCardDialog from KirigamiAddons."
msgstr "Uveli smo i praktičnu naredbenu traku sličnu onoj u Merkuru, koja omogućuje brz pristup važnim radnjama u Marknoteu. Trenutačno služi samo za stvaranje nove bilježnice i bilješke, no planiramo dodati još radnji. Naposljetku smo preradili sve dijaloge u Marknoteu kako bi upotrebljavali novi FormCardDialog iz KirigamiAddonsa."

#. (itstool) path: description/p
#: org.kde.marknote.metainfo.xml:189
msgid "Marknote, KDE's WYSIWYG note-taking application, is finally ready for it's first release. Marknote lets you create rich text notes and easily organise them into notebooks. You can personalise your notebooks by choosing an icon and accent color for each one, making it easy to distinguish between them and keep your notes at your fingertips. Your notes are saved as Markdown files in your Documents folder, making it easy to use your notes outside of Marknote as well as inside the app."
msgstr "Marknote, KDE-ova aplikacija za bilješke s WYSIWYG uređivanjem, napokon je spremna za prvo izdanje. Omogućuje stvaranje bilješki s obogaćenim tekstom i njihovo jednostavno organiziranje u bilježnice. Bilježnice možete personalizirati odabirom ikone i boje isticanja za svaku od njih pa ćete ih lakše razlikovati, a bilješke imati nadohvat ruke. Bilješke se spremaju kao Markdown datoteke u mapu Dokumenti, što olakšava njihovu uporabu i izvan aplikacije."

#. (itstool) path: description/p
#: org.kde.marknote.metainfo.xml:199
msgid "Thanks to Carl, Marknote now not only supports bold and italic fonts, but also lets you underline important parts, strike out wrong parts, organise your thoughts in various list types and organise your notes with titles, sections and more."
msgstr "Zahvaljujući Carlu, Marknote sada ne podržava samo podebljani i kurzivni tekst, već omogućuje i podcrtavanje važnih dijelova, precrtavanje pogrešnih dijelova, organiziranje misli u razne vrste popisa te uređivanje bilješki naslovima, odjeljcima i drugim elementima."

